    "title": "Air strikes carried out against pro-Iranian groups in Iraq - special services",
    "text": "RABAT, March 5. /TASS/. Several air strikes were carried out against the positions of pro-Iranian paramilitary groups stationed near the Iraqi city of Al-Qaim on the border with Syria, Iraqi security services reported.\nAccording to the report cited by the Al Hadath TV channel, the airstrikes hit the positions of groups near Al-Qaim in the Iraqi governorate of Anbar, on the Iraqi-Syrian border.\nThere is no information about possible casualties among the pro-Iranian forces.",
